Result
The 4-bit ALU was successfully designed and simulated using Verilog HDL. All arithmetic and logical operations produced correct outputs during simulation.

Conclusion
The project demonstrated the implementation of a basic ALU using combinational logic in Verilog HDL. Simulation results verified the correct functioning 
of all operations through waveform analysis
